    "reason": "[ev-2bd1a74f9c4a] says the release \"changes the defaults\" so policy exceptions are disabled and only allowed in a specified namespace. That describes Kyverno configuration defaults, not the meaning of the PolicyException CRD's spec field. The schema check [ev-e4d8d307c8bd][ev-f5ab4321b780] only shows that spec exists in both releases, so the crd-field subject is not supported. The evidence also doesn't name the Helm value, flag or config key that controls this, or its before/after values. Without those, the correct subject and the default-changed literals can't be written down. The missing piece is the linked upgrade guidance or chart values/flags diff that names the setting.",
